270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (This thesis developed a TON-based blockchain loyalty platform for B2B confectionery ecosystems. The proposed architecture combines smart contracts, a Telegram Mini App, and off-chain storage to improve reward transparency, simplify user interaction, and automate partner settlement. The results demonstrate the architectural feasibility of a coalition loyalty system built on TON.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
