/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (The study was evaluated at the MVP level using a small regional sample from Astana and Almaty. Production deployment, smart contract auditing, and large-scale performance testing were outside the scope of this research.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (Future work includes TON mainnet deployment, independent smart contract audits, expansion to other retail sectors, and DAO-based governance for platform management. Further research should evaluate long-term customer engagement, expand the architecture beyond confectionery businesses to other retail sectors.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
